# Story page: nm-keg
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Chain Reaction
---
One spark became two, and two became all of them.

{name} raced through a world that was exploding on purpose, one step ahead of the next blast and one step behind the last.

'Everything ends,' said the coil, 'but not everything ends so loudly.' I have kept my fingers in my ears ever since.
